      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What weight darts should beginners start with?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "A common starting range for beginners is between 22 and 24 grams with a straight tungsten barrel. Darts in this middle-weight bracket offer a versatile balance of stability and control, allowing you to establish consistent mechanics before exploring lighter or heavier preferences." }
    },
